  · exact P162_1.lines t5 h36 h89 h159 h171 h172 c h.1 (by omega)
  · exact P162_2.lines t5 h172 h173 c h.1 (by omega)
  · exact P162_3.lines t5 h157 h159 h173 c h.1 (by omega)

